Audio samples in this directory are from Sonatina Symphonic Orchestra (SSO),
created by Mattias Westlund (2011) and maintained at https://github.com/peastman/sso

Licensed under the Creative Commons Sampling Plus 1.0 license:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/sampling+/1.0/

The original WAV/FLAC samples were converted to MP3 (128 kbps) for browser
playback. File names follow the mapping in src/assets/samples.json.
